<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-yr govt bond yield drops to 20.56pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-yr govt bond yield drops to 20.56pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-year government bonds was set by auction at 20.56 percent, down from 21.47 percent at an auction on Dec 19, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>BOND OF THE 1999/E SERIES</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    18,750 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     55,446.48 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   18,750 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		24,375 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	  20.56 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		   99.84 pct</p>
</text>
